    <string name="home_hint">Each chore to do is a weed in the grass. Finishing it pulls the weed and grows flowers, more for harder chores. The more chores wait, the worse the weather: clouds, then rain, then a storm. Points count over the last 7 days, so the garden never resets. The lights stay on while nothing is overdue.</string>
